\f0\fs26 \cf2 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone # Mini Jarvis \'97 Canonical Project Documentation\
\
**Project:** Mini Jarvis  \
**Owner:** Tony Provenzano  \
**Platform:** Raspberry Pi 5 Model B Rev 1.1, 16GB RAM  \
**Operating System:** Debian GNU/Linux 13, trixie  \
**Project State:** Stable local AI appliance  \
**Documentation Date:** April 29, 2026  \
\
---\
\
## 1. Project Purpose\
\
Mini Jarvis is a local, offline AI terminal running on a Raspberry Pi 5. It provides a desktop graphical interface for interacting with local Ollama language models through a Tkinter GUI.\
\
The system is designed to behave like an appliance:\
\
- Boots into a usable AI terminal\
- Runs locally without cloud dependency\
- Streams responses\
- Keeps a fast model ready by default\
- Allows a deeper model to be selected from the GUI\
- Logs conversations locally\
- Maintains a 60-day rolling log history\
- Uses systemd for reliable automatic startup\
\
